OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation launched
OL,4,Aafter woman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after a woman was found dead
OL,8,Fat a property in Manchester.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to reports of a
OL,11,Fdisturbance at an address on Crondall
OL,12,FStreet in Moss Side at about 13:30 BST.
OL,14,FEmergency services found the body of a
OL,15,Fwoman and a 26-year-old woman was
OL,16,Farrested on suspicion of murder.
OL,18,FDet Ch Insp Louise Edwards said police
OL,19,Fbelieved the incident was isolated and
OL,20,Fthere was no wider threat to the
OL,21,Fcommunity.
